{"unit_id":"bluechips-zhao__dsh-browser-slotpool#card-zh","repo":"bluechips-zhao/dsh-browser-slotpool","commit":"aa57668afd6870a903a541c05d437a510d84d913","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-slotpool（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为并发 DSH 会话提供隔离的 Playwright 浏览器槽位。它通过 bundle 注册 mcp-client，并由启动器选择 CDP 端口、准备 Chrome，再连接 Playwright MCP。主要功能有分配空闲槽位、回收失效锁、复用已就绪浏览器，以及把浏览器工具接入 MCP。适合同时运行多个浏览器会话的用户。使用前需要配置启动器路径，并安装 Node.js 与 Chrome 或 Chromium。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:13-26","bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:282-312"]}
{"unit_id":"bluechips-zhao__dsh-browser-slotpool#card-en","repo":"bluechips-zhao/dsh-browser-slotpool","commit":"aa57668afd6870a903a541c05d437a510d84d913","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browser-slotpool is a DSH Web plugin for concurrent Playwright sessions. Its bundle registers an mcp-client; the launcher assigns a CDP port, starts or reuses Chrome, and connects Playwright MCP. It reclaims stale locks. Requires Node.js, Chrome or Chromium, and a launcher path.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:13-26","bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:282-312"]}
