{"unit_id":"bluechips-zhao__dsh-browser-slotpool#feature-1","repo":"bluechips-zhao/dsh-browser-slotpool","commit":"aa57668afd6870a903a541c05d437a510d84d913","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-slotpool 的功能「浏览器槽位分配」：启动时按配置顺序尝试取得空闲 CDP 端口锁。每个 mcp-client 会话占用一个槽位；槽位用尽时会报告占用情况并退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:105-125","bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:282-300"]}
{"unit_id":"bluechips-zhao__dsh-browser-slotpool#feature-2","repo":"bluechips-zhao/dsh-browser-slotpool","commit":"aa57668afd6870a903a541c05d437a510d84d913","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-slotpool 的功能「失效锁回收」：启动器检查锁记录中的进程是否仍存活；若持有进程已退出，就删除陈旧锁并重新尝试分配槽位。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:76-103"]}
{"unit_id":"bluechips-zhao__dsh-browser-slotpool#feature-3","repo":"bluechips-zhao/dsh-browser-slotpool","commit":"aa57668afd6870a903a541c05d437a510d84d913","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-slotpool 的功能「启动或复用 Chrome」：启动器先探测所选端口的 CDP 服务，已就绪便复用；未就绪时查找 Chrome 并启动，等待服务响应后再继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:152-173","bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:176-212"]}
{"unit_id":"bluechips-zhao__dsh-browser-slotpool#feature-4","repo":"bluechips-zhao/dsh-browser-slotpool","commit":"aa57668afd6870a903a541c05d437a510d84d913","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-slotpool 的功能「连接 Playwright MCP」：启动器将选定端口作为 CDP endpoint，启动本机配置的 Playwright MCP 命令，并把其标准输入输出接入 MCP 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/browser-slotpool.mjs:229-253"]}
